pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "#FFFFFF"
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 36, 400, 16]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      wrap: false
      text: THE PROBLEM
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 56, 848, 36]
    content:
      style: "$pageTitle"
      wrap: false
      text: 通用 Agent 做投研，缺的不是对话能力
  - elementId: title-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [56, 102, 848, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: p1-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 126, 44, 30]
    content: {fontSize: 20, color: "$accent", bold: true, wrap: false, text: "01"}
  - elementId: p1-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [108, 124, 220, 24]
    content: {fontSize: 16, color: "$ink", bold: true, wrap: false, text: "可复现的引擎"}
  - elementId: p1-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [108, 150, 700, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      color: "$body"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: 结论必须来自真实数据与真实计算，而不是模型即兴生成——没有引擎，所有"研报"都无法复核、无法追责。
  - elementId: p1-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [56, 196, 848, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: p2-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 214, 44, 30]
    content: {fontSize: 20, color: "$accent", bold: true, wrap: false, text: "02"}
  - elementId: p2-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [108, 212, 220, 24]
    content: {fontSize: 16, color: "$ink", bold: true, wrap: false, text: "合规边界"}
  - elementId: p2-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [108, 238, 700, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      color: "$body"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: Agent 的权限越来越大，"永远不碰真钱"必须是架构级保证——写在提示词里的约束，模型随时可以绕过。
  - elementId: p2-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [56, 284, 848, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: p3-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 302, 44, 30]
    content: {fontSize: 20, color: "$accent", bold: true, wrap: false, text: "03"}
  - elementId: p3-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [108, 300, 220, 24]
    content: {fontSize: 16, color: "$ink", bold: true, wrap: false, text: "持续性"}
  - elementId: p3-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [108, 326, 700, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      color: "$body"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: 投资观点要被记录、被定时检验、被事后追责——一次性问答不构成研究，没有台账就没有复盘。
  - elementId: p3-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [56, 372, 848, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: p4-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 390, 44, 30]
    content: {fontSize: 20, color: "$accent", bold: true, wrap: false, text: "04"}
  - elementId: p4-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [108, 388, 220, 24]
    content: {fontSize: 16, color: "$ink", bold: true, wrap: false, text: "多市场"}
  - elementId: p4-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [108, 414, 700, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      color: "$body"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: 美股、A股、港股各有数据源与交易逻辑——单一引擎覆盖不了，需要的是可组合的编排层。
  - elementId: p4-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [56, 460, 848, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: verdict
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 478, 848, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$primary"
      bold: true
      wrap: false
      text: Alpha Desk 的解法：用 deepseek-harness 的四个扩展点，一一补上这四块短板 →
  - elementId: pagenum
    elementType: text
    bounds: [870, 512, 34, 14]
    content: {style: "$small", align: [right, middle], wrap: false, text: "02"}
